<title>USA: Boyd Gaming acquisition wins okay in Ill.</title>
<headline>Boyd Gaming acquisition wins okay in Ill.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyd Gaming Corp said on Tuesday the Illinois Gaming Board has approved its $175-million acquisition of Par-a-Dice Gaming Corp, owner and operator of the Par-a-Dice Riverboat and a 208-room hotel in East Peoria, Illinois.</p>
<p>The acquisition will bring to 12 the number of properties Boyd currently operates.</p>
</text>
